      "content": "but it's not that simple. i can see it in their eyes when they talk about the future, like they're expecting something from me that i just can't give. if i keep going like this, i'm just going to keep dragging them down and making them feel more shame. it feels like no matter what i do, the mistake is already made. it's like i've already ruined the one thing they ever cared about.",
