      "content": "i know you say that, but honesty just feels like i'm hitting them with more bad news every day. i feel like i'm just a burden they have to carry. i hate that they even have to deal with me at all. wouldn't it just be easier for everyone if they didn't have to worry about my failures anymore? like, if i wasn't here to constantly let them down, wouldn't they just be able to move on and find peace without all this weight hanging over them?",
